{"availability":"available","full":"zoriya/Kyoo","name":"Kyoo","description":"A portable and vast media library solution.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":2529,"forks":79,"created":"2019-08-04T00:12:27Z","updated":"2026-10-05T00:56:11Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://kyoo.zoriya.dev","topics":["docker","ffmpeg","golang","jellyfin","mediabrowser","netflix","next","plex","python","react-native","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://kyoo.zoriya.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:30.759Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:30.759Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:30.759Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:53.768Z","stars":2529,"forks":78},{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:30.759Z","stars":2529,"forks":79}],"technologies":["React","Next.js","Python","Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Kyoo is a self-hosted media server focused on video content (Movies, Series & Anime). It is an alternative to Jellyfin or Plex.","It aims to have a low amount of maintenance needed (no folder structure required nor manual metadata edits). Media not being scanned correctly (even with weird names) is considered a bug.","Kyoo does not have a plugin system and aim to have every features built-in (see #Features for the list)."],"features":["Dynamic Transcoding: Transcode to any quality, support ABR (automatic quality switching based on network), even with original quality.","No folder structure: Kyoo is there to help you manage your medias, we do not require you to already have a well organized media library. Bad naming, everything in the same directory, weird anime names, everything works…","Video Preview Thumbnails: Simply hover the video's progress bar and see a preview of the video.","Vlc backed player: On android (and android tv soon), we use VLC to support as many codecs as possible (you can use exoplayer if you want to too).","Intro/Credit detection: Automatically detect intro/credits with audio fingerprinting (or chapter title matching)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zoriya/Kyoo/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"8171599cc56d99eeda81752c3394f42f599cccfa454c7b5258f4c76982faaad1","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:54.814Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:30.865Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Kyoo is a self-hosted media server focused on video content (Movies, Series & Anime). It is an alternative to Jellyfin or Plex.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zoriya/Kyoo/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8171599cc56d99eeda81752c3394f42f599cccfa454c7b5258f4c76982faaad1","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zoriya/Kyoo/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:30.865Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T00:56:11Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zoriya/Kyoo/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:30.866Z","hash":"8171599cc56d99eeda81752c3394f42f599cccfa454c7b5258f4c76982faaad1","originalBytes":5278,"storedBytes":5278,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["kyoo","soon","support","android","clients","even","features","services","video","want","any","automatically","directory","discord","download","list","low","media","multiple","oidc","project","see","structure","there","watch","anime","api","ask","available","available.","being","code","contribute","demo","everything","few","folder","helm","installation","intro","jellyfin","live","might","movies","names","need","only","open","player","please","preview","progress","quality","questions","reimplemented","started","synced","translations","uses","vlc","web","weird","work","yet","about","abr","access","action","adapting","add","aim","aims","all.","allow","already","alternative","amount","another","apps","ass","audio","authelia","automatic","backed","bad","bar","based","basic","better.","blender","box.","browse","bug.","bugs","built-in","burden","chapter","chart","chart.","chromecast","chromeca